mold provides a CMake target:

    find_package(mold CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE mold::mdlib)

md_gl.c compiles its GLSL at runtime and looks for it relative to the running executable,
at <exe_dir>/../modules/molecule/shaders/mold/ (or ../../ for a Windows multi-config build
tree). The package exposes those shader sources as MOLD_SHADER_DIR; a consumer has to copy
them to that location.
